        verification storySetJudgmentWritePathDoD : Test { :>> id = "fed7a6d7-3d83-431a-87e4-bb58dd086307"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::test; :>> procedureText = "keel judge-set <file> (--words|--note) --by <human> --date [--verdict pass|fail] [--fail a,b] [--all] writes for each sampled unjudged proposal a <test>R<n+1> TestResult (judgedBy the human, createdBy the recorder, judgedAgainst HEAD) and a <test>Attest<k> confirmation companion quoting the human verbatim plus its own pass; the set is computed from attestation-policy.toml [proposedJudgment] sampling (a share or a count) over result-uuid order with judged proposals counted into the sample first, an absent rule samples everything, --all judges every unjudged proposal; keel attestation reports proposed, sampled, judged and awaiting as separate numbers with the rule; from an agent session a note without the human's quoted words is refused writing nothing and a judge-set:no-quote ledger line, and without the confirmationRecord delegation quoted words are refused as no recording delegation; judge-set joins HUMAN_ONLY_WRITE_COMMANDS and HUMAN_AUTHORITY_COMMANDS so an AI-kind judge is refused before any line is built; the deck shows one judgment card per file with a sampled set awaiting, tapping /api/judge-set with the device receipt appended as an acceptance tap is; the verb is a CliCommand fact, in COMMAND_NAMES, in --help, and the two census write-path rows exist. D0388 pair in attestation.rs: known-positive - six proposals under a 50% rule sample three by uuid and judge none; known-negative - one human pass on a proposal reads as judged and counted first, and a tree of plain passes proposes nothing. Integration test judge_set_records_each_item: four proposals with 50% sampling judge two (one --fail), the file validates and passes confirmation-authenticity and attestation-substance, a second plain call writes nothing, --all judges the rest, the census reads 4/4/4/0, the no-quote and no-delegation refusals hold with the ledger line named. validate, check-engine, guard --no-receipt (stpa-currency warning grows by cmdJudgeSet), sync-claude --check and clippy -D warnings clean."; }
